- ☐ All JSON bodies are size‑limited (ready for future POSTs).  
- ☐ Structured logger is in place.  
- ☐ Global error handler + 404 (no stack traces leak).  
- ☐ Uncaught errors & unhandled rejections are caught.  
- ☐ Remove `console.log`, replace with logger.  
- ☐ Prepare validation hooks (celebrate/Joi) for any future param/qs parsing.

